          "The designer establishes the load cases, member arrangement and guard system, while the supplier proposes the documented laminate and fabrication package. The team reviews a representative connection and the most congested removable panel before releasing all parts. The purchase order assigns anchors, hardware, engineering review, installation and inspection to named parties and defines the evidence needed at each release point.",
          "Before shutdown, the plant confirms access, isolation, temporary edge protection and the delivery sequence. At completion, the team checks the installed configuration against the accepted design and records remaining issues. The mill receives an as-built arrangement, material identities and inspection instructions. This gives purchasing a repeatable spare-parts reference and gives maintenance a clear basis for evaluating changes in service.",
